cmd-dhdaynight-desc = Time of day on your map; with a 0–1 argument, set it (0 midnight, 0.25 sunrise, 0.5 noon, 0.75 sunset).
cmd-dhdaynight-help = Usage: dhdaynight [day fraction 0–1]
cmd-dhdaynight-no-cycle = This map has no day/night cycle.
cmd-dhdaynight-bad = Give a day fraction from 0 to 1 (e.g. 0.5 is noon).
cmd-dhdaynight-status = { $map }: { $time } (fraction { $fraction }), light { $color }; a day lasts { $minutes } min.
